# Git commits — no Cursor attribution

When creating git commits in this repository:

- Never add `Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>` (or any Cursor co-author line).
- Never add `Made-with: Cursor` (or similar Cursor attribution trailers).
- Commit author should remain the human maintainer only.

These trailers cause GitHub to list "Cursor Agent" as a repository contributor.
